QuestGuidance.Register("es",399,{
[12737]="70054667\n1\tDefeat spiders in Taurlingol (total: 15)\tYou have entered a forest overwhelmed with spiders in Cirith Ungol. You should defeat many spiders in Taurlingol.\n2\tTalk to Atli Spider-bane\tAtli can be found on a hill near Taurlingol. You should talk to Atli Spider-bane.\n",
[12738]="7000184F\n1\tDerrota orcos en los campos del sur de Gatson (total: 8)\tSe pueden encontrar orcos en los campos del sur de Gatson. El granjero Gatson acepta que los Montaraces no pueden ayudarle, pero aún le preocupa la seguridad de sus trabajadores. Espera que, al encargarte de los exploradores orcos que han estado robando en sus campos, puedas disuadir un ataque violento a su granja.\n2\tHabla con Gatson\tGatson está en su granja, al norte de los campos. Has encontrado y derrotado a muchos orcos en los campos del sur de Gatson. Deberías regresar con Gatson y contarle tu éxito.\n",
[12739]="70001205\n1\tHabla con el capitán de la guardia Gisur cuando estés [según el diario].\tLos Orcos se están movilizando contra Gabilshathûr. El capitán de la guardia Gisur te ha pedido que ayudes a defender Gabilshathûr de un ataque orco.\n2\tHabla con Guard-captain Gisur\tEl capitán de la guardia Gisur está en Gabilshathûr. Ayudaste a rechazar el ataque orco y deberías hablar con Gisur, ahora que el peligro ha pasado.\n",
[12740]="7006551C\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Taustrok (total: 10)\tHorndir has asked you to deal with the Orc presence at Taustrok before it grows in strength enough to threaten the Harlond. The Orcs have gathered at a small camp, north-west of the Harlond.\n2\tReturn to Horndir\tYou should let Horndir know that you have defeated many of the Orcs who were gathering and trying to regroup north-west of the Harlond. Horndir is in the Harlond.\n",
[12741]="7002C91D\n1\tDefiende el campamento de los Rohirrim\tEl ataque de los orcos será pronto. Debes hablar con Rothulf una vez más para comenzar la defensa del pequeño campamento de Wynmar.\n2\tHabla con Rothulf\tRothulf se encuentra en el campamento de cazadores al sur de Thinglad, preparándose para partir hacia Stangard. Debes hablar con Rothulf.\n",
[12742]="70041217\n1\tDefeat Orcs in the Dead Marshes ([según el diario]/8)\tArtamir has asked you to defeat Orcs throughout the Dead Marshes, for the creatures seem to have followed him here and are making completion of his errand more difficult. Furthermore, if Frodo did come this way, the Orcs drawn here by Artamir's presence could complicate matters.\n2\tYou have faced many Orcs in the Dead Marshes, but there are more out there and you should defeat them for Artamir.\t\n3\tBring the crumpled parchment to Artamir at his camp in the Dead Marshes\tYou found a parchment in the clutches of an Orc in the Dead Marshes, and should bring it to Artamir at his camp.\n",
[12743]="7005857B\n1\tDefeat Orcs at Hanksar-mokh\tThe Orc camp Hanksar-mokh sits south-west of Gundabad. Defeating Orcs there would send a strong message.\n2\tDefeat Orcs at Hanksar-mokh (total: 10)\tThe Orc camp Hanksar-mokh sits south-west of Gundabad. Defeating Orcs there would send a strong message.\n3\tCompletado\tYou have defeated a number of Orcs at Hanksar-mokh.\n",
[12744]="7006753F\n1\tFind the Orcs of Jeb Khâtel\tPhocas has asked you to head north to Jeb Khâtel and find the Orcs that dwell there.\n2\tFind someone in Kafagur who is willing to talk to you\tYour presence in Kafagur has not gone unnoticed, but many of the Orcs seem unwilling to talk to you. You should find someone who is willing.\n3\tTalk to Grúshul\tYou've found an Orc in Kafagur named Grúshul who wishes to speak with you. You should talk to her.\n4\tFind Zagdúr in Kafagur\tGrúshul has given you permission to meet with the elder, Zagdúr. You should find her in Kafagur.\n5\tTalk to Shúkurz\tYou have found Kafagur's elder, as well as a familiar Orc by her side -- Shúkurz. You should talk to him.\n6\tTalk to Zagdúr\tZagdúr has politely interrupted your reunion with Shúkurz. You should talk to her in Kafagur.\n",
[12745]="7003E2AE\n1\tDerrota a Desolladores tarkrîp en el oeste de Nan Wathren (total: 15)\030Derrota a Tiradores Tarkrîp en el oeste de Nan Wathren (total: 10)\tLos orcos se encuentran en Nan Wathren, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte. Debes derrotar a un buen número de orcos en Nan Wathren. Se recomienda una Pequeña Comunidad.\n2\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a un buen número de orcos de Nan Wathren.\n",
[12746]="7003EE80\n1\tDerrota Luchadores Tarkrîp en Nan Wathren occidental (total: 10)\030Derrota Degolladores Tarkrîp en Nan Wathren occidental (total: 10)\tLos Degolladores y Luchadores Tarkrîp se encuentran en Nan Wathren oriental, en el sur de las Quebradas del Norte. Debes derrotar a un buen número de Degolladores y Luchadores Tarkrîp en Nan Wathren. Se recomienda una Comunidad.\n2\tCompletado\tHas derrotado a un buen número de orcos de Nan Wathren.\n",
[12747]="700413C9\n1\tDestroy Orkish totems (total: 4)\030Burn Orkish banners (total: 6)\tOrc structures can be found north-east of Ethring. Destroy Orkish structures in Ringló Vale.\n2\tSpeak with Arvaethor\tYou should speak with Arvaethor.\n",
[12748]="70043E08\n1\tDefiende el centro del puente de Ornendil\tEl puente de Ornendil se encuentra en el norte de Osgiliath sobre el río Anduin. Debes defender el centro del puente de Ornendil.\n2\tMantén tu puesto y defiende el centro del puente\tEl puente de Ornendil se encuentra en el norte de Osgiliath sobre el río Anduin. Debes mantener tu puesto y defender el centro del puente de Ornendil. Esta etapa incluye condiciones de fallo; revisa el diario antes de elegir objetos o acciones.\n3\tEscucha los gritos de Shíktarb hacia ti\tShíktarb se encuentra en Shrak Mauruk. Deberías escuchar lo que te grita Shíktarb.\n",
[12749]="70000130\n1\tReúne el segundo cofre\tLarus Fragmentoagudo cree que el segundo cofre está dentro de un edificio en la colina a tu izquierda al acercarte a la fortaleza controlada por los Duramano en el paso de Gabilazan desde el norte. Gabilazan está al sur del campamento donde se encuentra Larus. Larus Fragmentoagudo está muy preocupado de que Heikki Vigilaoro registre cosas poco favorables sobre él si no logras recuperar un segundo cofre enano desde las Montañas Nubladas.\n",
[12750]="70071B7A\n1\tTravel to Khanâg Gur\tSâdikiz the Sky-hungry can be found at Khanâg Gur. You should go there to find him.\n2\tComplete Instance: The Outcast\tSâdikiz the Sky-hungry can be found at Khanâg Gur. Mêshaget said to look for Sâdikiz's boar.\n3\tTalk to Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry\tYou saved Sâdikiz from being beaten by two bullies who claimed he owed them money. You should talk to Sâdikiz in Khanâg Gur, outside of the tavern.\n",
[12751]="7005843B\n1\tFind the missing scout\tLaugi should be somewhere near Zarkul-sulûn in southern Elderslade. Gunvald has asked you to look for his missing brother.\n",
[12752]="7005CC50\n1\tSearch for the vineyards\tThe vineyards may be in eastern Clovengap. Gerja has asked you to locate the fabled vineyards of Clovengap.\n2\tTalk to Gerja in Hagbuth\tGerja Defthand is in Hagbuth, in eastern Clovengap. You should let Gerja Defthand know that you found the vineyards.\n",
[12753]="7004A391\n1\tYou should search for Ushkbál the Overseer in the great foundry, on the northern side of Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr.\t\n2\tYou have not found Ushkbál the Overseer, but you have found signs of a bloody struggle. You should follow the footprints leading from the place and see where they lead.\t\n3\tTalk to the dwarves\tThe dwarves stand behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr. The trail of footprints led straight from signs of a bloody struggle to two dwarf-forgeworkers standing over a corpse. You should speak to them.\n4\tInspect the corpse\tThe corpse and dwarves are behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr. You should inspect the overseer's corpse to verify the dwarves' claim that he bears sword-wounds, while they hold only hammers.\n5\tTalk to Stéthi\030Talk to Slárnur\tThe dwarves are behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr. You should talk to the dwarves, now that you have verified that the overseer's corpse bears sword and not blunt wounds.\n6\tTalk to Kurtil\tKurtil stands near the dwarves and corpse, behind a cart high up the path in northern Udûn, above Maudhúl Vôr. Hear what Kurtil has to say.\n",
[12754]="70052964\n1\tHabla con Grimbeorn\tGrimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús in the Beorning-lands. You should talk to Grimbeorn.\n2\tTravel to the Carrock\tThe Carrock can be found on the western edge of the Beorning-lands in the Vales of Anduin. You should seek out Varthmath atop the Carrock.\n3\tTalk to Varthmath atop the Carrock\tThe Carrock can be found on the western edge of the Beorning-lands in the Vales of Anduin. You should seek out Varthmath atop the Carrock.\n4\tCordially bow to Anórohir\tAnórohir is on the Carrock. You should be polite to Anórohir.\n5\tTravel to the Eyrie with Anórohir\tAnórohir can be found atop the Carrock. You should travel to the Eyrie with Anórohir.\n6\tCordially bow to Gwaihir\tGwaihir the Wind-lord can be found at the Eyrie. You should be polite to Gwaihir.\n7\tTalk to Gwaihir the Windlord\tGwaihir the Wind-lord can be found at the Eyrie. You should talk to Gwaihir.\n",
[12755]="70030459\n1\tEscucha el relato de Léofmar\tLéofmar está en Fangorn. Debes hablar con Léofmar y escuchar su historia.\n2\tTranquiliza a Léofmar diciéndole que no consideras su crimen tan terrible\tLéofmar está en Fangorn. Debes hablar con Léofmar.\n3\tSilba para llamar al caballo de Léofmar\tDebes silbar para llamar al caballo de Léofmar. Debes estar cerca de Léofmar para poder hacerlo. Debes realizar una emote para avanzar en esta misión.\n4\tHabla con Léofmar de nuevo\tLéofmar está en Fangorn. Debes hablar con Léofmar una vez más.\n5\tEncuentra un nuevo Ent dormido en el norte\tDebes buscar otros Ents dormidos en el bosque, dirigiéndote al noreste desde la ubicación de Léofmar.\n",
[12756]="7002E4EF\n1\tEntrega las fichas de Hytbold a Edgal\030Recoge fichas de Hytbold (cantidad: según el diario)\tLa reconstrucción de Hytbold apenas comienza; queda mucho por hacer.\n",
